WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.387
The 1970s.

00:00:02.337 --> 00:00:05.162
Crisis and Multiculturalism.

00:00:05.162 --> 00:00:12.612
Pierre Trudeau invokes the War Measures Act during the October Crisis — the only peacetime use in Canadian history.

00:00:12.612 --> 00:00:16.350
Nearly 500 people arrested without charge.

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:20.337
Canada adopts official multiculturalism policy.

00:00:20.337 --> 00:00:24.737
The Parti Quebecois wins Quebec on a sovereignty platform.
